{% comment %}
"There is more here than you can see."

A gated trust center that silently hides advisories is indistinguishable from
one with nothing to hide, so a reader who could get access never asks for it.
This says how many are withheld and what would change that — and it words the
prompt from what the reader already is, rather than guessing.

Expects `hidden_count`, `viewer_is_authenticated`, `viewer_has_gated_grant`.
{% endcomment %}
{% if hidden_count %}
    <c-branded.notice title="{{ hidden_count }} advisor{{ hidden_count|pluralize:'y,ies' }} {{ hidden_count|pluralize:'is,are' }} restricted">
    {% if not viewer_is_authenticated %}
        These are shared with customers who have access to the affected products. Log in to see the ones covered by your access.
    {% elif not viewer_has_gated_grant %}
        These are shared with customers who have been granted access to this workspace. Request access to see the ones that apply to you.
    {% else %}
        These cover products outside your current access. If you believe one applies to you, contact us to extend your access.
    {% endif %}
    {% if not viewer_is_authenticated %}
        <c-slot name="action">
        <c-buttons.secondary size="sm" href="{% url 'core:keycloak_login' %}?next={{ request.path|urlencode }}">Sign in</c-buttons.secondary>
        </c-slot>
    {% endif %}
    </c-branded.notice>
{% endif %}
